          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            One of the affine
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kac-Moody+groups"} Kac-Moody groups
            in the E-series.
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E7"}> E7
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E6"} E6
